{"bookId": "24980841", "title": "高尔夫运动系统训练（全彩图解版）", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1729478731, "updated": [{"bookId": "24980841", "bookmarkId": "24980841_8_3419-3607", "createTime": 1729478731, "range": "3419-3607", "markText": "猫狗式练习\n￼", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8}, {"bookId": "24980841", "bookmarkId": "24980841_7_9443-9569", "createTime": 1729429147, "range": "9443-9569", "markText": "人们往往建议这样的球员放慢臀部的运动速度。而实际上，问题的关键不是球员臀部转动速度过快，而是没有使用腿部力量向目标侧移动，却错误地使用手臂力量发力。如果该球员学会使用腿部力量向地面发力，那么臀部明显的快速转动就能自动放缓，而杆头也能更轻松地从内部击球。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7}, {"bookId": "24980841", "bookmarkId": "24980841_7_9176-9217", "createTime": 1729428826, "range": "9176-9217", "markText": "此外，用腿确定球员的位置并且发力，有助于将失误概率降到最低，避免出现过高的右曲球。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "第2章 正确移动身体实现最佳挥杆角度", "chapterUid": 8, "chapterIdx": 8}, {"title": "第1章 运动中的高尔夫球员", "chapterUid": 7, "chapterIdx": 7}], "book": {"bookId": "24980841", "version": 1833640127, "format": "epub", "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/66/YueWen_24980841/s_YueWen_24980841.jpg", "title": "高尔夫运动系统训练（全彩图解版）", "author": "克雷格·戴维斯 文斯·迪赛亚", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KDPGvw#W*0F3NsxD5~RjMd", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#002316"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#002613"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#002911"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#103829"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#003a26"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#003d24"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#23503e"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#00533a"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#005637"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#005a33"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#166d50"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#007449"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#3a6955"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#008f5f"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#54836d"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#008b63"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#6b9e86"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#53a280"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#30a67b"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#00ad73"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#52c194"}, {"key": "7/10", 